{"2150900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Celtique", "steam_appid": 2150900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celtique (Celestial Boutique)</strong> is a high-speed rhythm driving game set on a hostile alien world where music is your only navigation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vast extraterrestrial landscapes as every turn, boost, and drift is synchronized to the beat. The track <i>is</i> the song - master momentum, timing, and flow as you push your vehicle through  biomechanical highways that react dynamically to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional racing game. Speed alone is not enough. Precision, musical awareness, and instinct define survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay</strong> – Steering, acceleration, boosts, and hazards are fully synchronized to the soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals</strong> – The world pulses, shifts, and evolves with the music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celtique is about entering a trance—where engine noise fades, rhythm takes control, and the road becomes music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the beat.<br>Become the rhythm.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Celtique (Celestial Boutique)</strong> is a high-speed rhythm driving game set on a hostile alien world where music is your only navigation system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across vast extraterrestrial landscapes as every turn, boost, and drift is synchronized to the beat. The track <i>is</i> the song - master momentum, timing, and flow as you push your vehicle through  biomechanical highways that react dynamically to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a traditional racing game. Speed alone is not enough. Precision, musical awareness, and instinct define survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm-Driven Gameplay</strong> – Steering, acceleration, boosts, and hazards are fully synchronized to the soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Visuals</strong> – The world pulses, shifts, and evolves with the music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celtique is about entering a trance—where engine noise fades, rhythm takes control, and the road becomes music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive the beat.<br>Become the rhythm.</p>", "short_description": "Celtique is a high-speed rhythm driving game set on a hostile alien world where music is your only navigation system.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/c63c8bad00a57be3c384b98b0449118c9c8fe202/header.jpg?t=1772674676", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/d35b012cec3f42c655fc8bd8800c315d995d6923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772674676", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2150900/d35b012cec3f42c655fc8bd8800c315d995d6923/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772674676", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-12700K / AMD Ryzen 9 5900<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB availab